# Camunda Provider

The Camunda provider manages resources on [Camunda 8 SaaS](https://camunda.com/platform/)
through the [Administration API](https://docs.camunda.io/docs/apis-tools/administration-api/administration-api-reference/):
clusters, cluster API clients, connector secrets, IP allowlists and organization members.

